==Incidents and Accidents==
<li>On July 15, 1975, Sanese Airways '''Flight 17''', a (Manufacturer) (Boeing 727), crashed upon approach at Okami International Airport 63 of the 120 people on board were killed. The accident was blamed on pilot error.
<li>On January 12, 1992, '''Flight 2''' missed an approach and skidded to a farm field outside of Aizawa International Airport. No passengers were killed.

